        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie Kaye Thomas, Chris Klein, Autumn Reeser\n- Works: American Pie film series, Nature of the Beast\n- Companies: Universal Pictures\n\nFacts:\n- Universal Pictures released the first American Pie film in 1999, and it became a worldwide pop culture phenomenon with a cult following.\n- Chris Klein was born on March 14, 1979, and he is an American actor best known for playing Chris \"Oz\" Ostreicher in the American Pie comedy teen films.\n- Eddie Kaye Thomas was born on October 31, 1980, and he rose to prominence as Paul Finch in the American Pie film series.\n- Nature of the Beast is a 2007 television film starring Autumn Reeser and Eddie Kaye Thomas.",
